<title>CANADA: Wascana Energy extends rights separation.</title>
<headline>Wascana Energy extends rights separation.</headline>
<dateline>REGINA, Saskatchewan 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Takeover target Wascana Energy Inc said on Thursday its board of directors extended the separation time of rights issued under its shareholder rights plan to 20 business days after February 12 or later.</p>
<p>Talisman Energy Inc announced its intention to make a C$1.7-billion cash and stock offer for Wascana on February 12.</p>
<p>Under Wascana's poison pill, rights issued will continue to trade with the company's shares until the separation time, the company said. ((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
